          },
          "text": "Introduction"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 8,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If you find this work helpful, please consider supporting my work by becoming a "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 81
          },
          "url": "https://github.com/sponsors/riderx",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 8,
                "column": 82
              },
              "text": "Github sponsor"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 8,
            "column": 133
          },
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 10,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 10,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "I made a bet to open-source all the code I built here instead of paywalling it. By opening it up instead of fighting and hiding, I believe we can make the world a better place."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 12,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 12,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Furthermore, I want to focus on Capgo tooling, and make it an open and transparent business."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 14,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 14,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "But to make it possible, it is necessary for all of us to do our part, including you 🥹."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 16,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 16,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "If Capgo doesn't suit you, then pay your own price and "
        },
        {
          "type": "link",
          "location": {
            "line": 16,
            "column": 56
          },
          "url": "https://github.com/sponsors/riderx",
          "title": null,
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "location": {
                "line": 16,
                "column": 57
              },
              "text": "back a bootstrapped Maker"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 16,
            "column": 119
          },
          "text": " on your terms."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "component",
