      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 75,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Install Capacitor updater"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 77,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "bash",
      "meta": "title=\"Install the Capacitor updater\"",
      "text": "npm install @capgo/capacitor-updater\nnpx cap sync"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "location": {
        "line": 82,
        "column": 1
      },
      "depth": 2,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 82,
            "column": 4
          },
          "text": "Prepare your bundle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 84,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 84,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "To send updates to your app, you need to zip it.\nThe best way to be certain your zip is good is to use the Capgo CLI for zipping."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "location": {
        "line": 86,
        "column": 1
      },
      "lang": "bash",
      "meta": "title=\"Create a bundle with your files to serve from your server\"",
      "text": "npx @capgo/cli@latest bundle zip"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 91,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 91,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "You will have to serve this zip from your server on your own."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
