      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 104,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": ":::note\nIf this seems like a lot of work, try the trial Capgo Cloud.\n:::"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "location": {
        "line": 108,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 108,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": ":::note\nDelta (manifest) updates will not work in manual updates, but they can work in auto update. Right now it's not documented because it's a pretty complex process.\n:::"
        }
      ]
    },
